\nIf booked you agree to our policy terms and conditions\n\n##Duration:\nDo not expect a set time schedule on this adventure! Tour time duration is not exact 2.5 to 3 hours.\ndepends on weather conditions, how long you snorkel, wildlife we may run into ,etc. \n\n##WILDLIFE GUIDELINES:\n*No Touching or Petting dolphins/whales\n*No Feeding dolphins/whales\n*No Riding dolphins/whales\n*No Chasing dolphins/whales\n*No Swimming or pursing after dolphins/whales\n*No Harassing dolphins/whales\n*This is not a swim with Dolphins, but you may see them.\n\n##To qualify for the tour:\n* Age Recommendation limit 4 - 65 (if not in that range please call us)\n* No pregnancy\n* No neck, back or mental problems\n* Know how to swim & can tread water unassisted\n* You must weigh under 275\n\n##VESSEL STYLE:\nRIB Zodiac Navy Seal Speed Boat", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "ALOHA! \nMUST READ EVERYTHING BELOW:\n\n2nd snorkel location is NOT guaranteed depends on many different conditions and situations.\n\n\n****EQUIPTMENT:\n\n•Mask & snorkel \nare included on your ticket price.\nThis is the only equipment necessary or mandatory to do the tour.\n\n• Rental /cleaning fee \n$10 lifejacket ( 12 & Younger FREE )\n$15 upper body jacket wetsuit \n$20 Fins\n$30 shorty full body wetsuit \n$30 floating waterproof phone case \n( based upon availability )\n\nFins are NOT necessary or mandatory.\nNo currents or riptides here at this bay it’s like a Swimming Pool…! \n\nYou are more than welcome to bring Fins if you have them and can use them properly.\n\nPlease do NOT kick and splash hard as it will scare all the fish away. Another reason why we don’t provide them. Most guests have never used them & don’t know how to use them properly. Not using fins is best we recommend everyone taking their time swimming slowly here!\n\n\n****TOUR DURATION & DELAY POLICY:\n\nTour durations are estimates — not exact. \n2.5 to 3 hours approximately\n\nDelays can occur due to:\n\nWeather conditions\nBoat traffic\nMechanical issues\nGuest capacity requirements\nOther unforeseen circumstances\nYour tour may be delayed or moved to an earlier time on rare occasions — sometimes by an hour or more.\nWe do not issue refunds for delays or rescheduling.\nPlease do not schedule anything within 1 hour before or after your tour.\n\n\n\n****GUEST RESPONSIBILITIES:\n\nAllow a 1-hour buffer before/after your scheduled time.\nProvide a working phone number \nStay available and responsive on the day of your tour.\n\n\n\n****BOAT CAPACITY POLICY:\n\nMinimum of 8 guests required for a tour to operate.\nIf the tour doesn't meet this minimum, we’ll move you to another time or day.\nYou will be contacted at least 30 minutes prior if your tour needs to be rescheduled.\n(This rarely happens.)\n\n\n\n****ABOUT THE BOAT:\n\nRIB Zodiac Navy Seal Vessel \n\n\n\n****Wildlife Policy:\n\nDolphins are wild animals, and their presence can never be guaranteed. While we do our absolute best to take you to the right place at the right time, we cannot control nature—and we do not issue refunds\n\nWILDLIFE IS NOT GUARANTEED TO SHOW UP \n\n\n\n****RESTRICTIONS:\n\nFor your safety, guests must:\n\nMUST KNOW HOW TO SWIM AND TREAD WATER WITH YOUR OWN STRENGTH\nBe physically able to climb up a boat ladder\nMust weigh less than 275 LBS\nNot have back/neck problems\nNot be pregnant\n\n\n\n****WHAT TO BRING:\n\nMust wear and arrive in swimsuits.\nTowel \nReef safe Sunscreen \nSandals\nPhone\nVehicle keys\nWallet \nMust fit in Small Bag football size\n\nWe keep the items above in a container for you.\n\n\n\n****Gratuity for your captain & crew if wanted!\n\n\n\n****REVIEW POLICY\nBy purchasing tickets, you agree not to leave negative or retaliatory reviews due to situations out of our control such as:\n\nBad weather\nMechanical issues\nMinimum guest capacity not being met\nDelayed or rescheduled tours\nWILD ANIMALS not being present\n\n\n\n****UNDERSTAND THAT THERE ARE INHERENT RISKS INVOLVED WITH SNORKELING AND BOATING, included but not limited to equipment failure, perils of the sea, physical and mental harm caused by marine creatures including bites & stings, acts of fellow participants, entering and exiting the water, boarding or disembarking boats, and activities on the docks and I HEREBY ASSUME SUCH RISKS. There is no refunds if this listed above occurs. \n\n\n**** No Refund dispute back charges with banks / credit or debit cards, Doing so would be fraud and will be handled legally with our attorney.\nIf you would like a refund, you must do so within our policy, which is 72 hours before the tour.\nIf a refund is needed because we cancel the tour, we will refund it for you on our end.\n\n****By booking tickets, you agree to all policy terms and conditions above.\n\n\n****CHECK-IN TIME:\nA minimum of 15 minutes early\nBEFORE YOUR TOUR TIME\n\n\n\n****CHECK IN ADDRESS: \n78-7100 Kaleiopapa st.\nKailua-Kona, Hawaii 96740\n\nMeet at the Tall White Rental Wetsuit Van across the street entrance of the OUT RIGGER RESORT & SPA sign with tall palm trees with Christmas lights and tiki torches. \n\nMeet at the solo Lamppost next to the boat ramp AFTER the van check in\n\nThe crew will get you from underneath the light pole or restroom upon returning from previous trip. \nThere will be no refunds or reschedules if you miss the boat.\n\nGet here early to find parking on the side of the street\n\nDO NOT PARK IN THE TRAILER STALLS - YOU WILL BE TOWED\nAND/OR TICKETED.\nFREE SIDE STREET PARKING IS AVAILABLE AND THERE ARE LIMITED PARKING SPACES IN THE BEACH PARKING LOT BY THE OUTRIGGER HOTEL.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 0, "headline": "*ticket pricing is seasonal*", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hawaiiislandandoceantours/items/159432/images/970089/", "pk": 970089, "unicode": "